			"notes": "## Release\n\n- Loaders:\n  - `Fabric`\n  - `NeoForge`\n  - `Forge`\n- Minecraft: `1.21.x`\n- Java: `21`\n- Version: `5.6.0+mc1.21`\n\n## Changelog\n\n- Standardized Fabric artifacts as `ADL-<mod version>-Fabric-<Minecraft series>.jar`.\n- Added Forge and NeoForge builds alongside Fabric.\n- Added one runtime JAR per loader for the Minecraft 1.21 series.\n- Fixed a mob-death crash on Minecraft 1.21.9 and newer caused by an incompatible world-accessor descriptor.\n- Added normal equipment drop rolls for non-player kills according to `loot_drop_mode`.\n- Restored the vanilla 8.5% equipment roll when affected 1.21.x versions initialize an equipped slot with a zero drop chance.\n- Added Brazilian Portuguese gamerule translations.\n- Added deferred gamerule registration for Minecraft 1.21.11 while retaining the legacy path through 1.21.10.\n- Preserved gamerule data and world entry across the 1.21.10/1.21.11 transition.\n- Updated the mod author and project contact links."
		},
