			"notes": "## Release\n\n- Loaders:\n  - `Fabric`\n  - `NeoForge`\n  - `Forge`\n- Minecraft: `1.20.x`\n- Java: `17+` (`21` for Minecraft `1.20.5` and `1.20.6`)\n- Version: `5.6.0+mc1.20`\n\n## Changelog\n\n- Standardized Fabric artifacts as `ADL-<mod version>-Fabric-<Minecraft series>.jar`.\n- Added Forge and NeoForge builds alongside Fabric.\n- Added one runtime JAR per loader for the supported Minecraft 1.20 versions.\n- Added normal equipment drop rolls for non-player kills according to `loot_drop_mode`.\n- Added Brazilian Portuguese gamerule translations.\n- Added compatibility across the 1.20.4/1.20.5 mapping transition and NeoForge 1.20.1 through 1.20.6.\n- Fixed legacy Forge loading and zombie-death crashes.\n- Updated the mod author and project contact links."
